  "notes": [
    "Use client-area coordinates for screenshot capture, OCR, and image recognition.",
    "Do not persist HWND, PID, or window position because they change between game sessions.",
    "Calculate the outer window size from the current window style instead of relying on the reference size.",
    "In valuePattern, /xxx, /yyy, and /zzz represent variable numeric values in their appearance order.",
    "In valuePattern, /text represents variable text.",
    "Any content in valuePattern that is not a slash placeholder is fixed text used to validate and normalize OCR output.",
    "The HH:mm:ss valuePattern represents a 24-hour time value.",
    "For healthBar, the first numeric line is current health and the second numeric line is fixed or maximum health.",
    "A mainInfo item with recognitionType set to text is detected by OCR and must define valuePattern.",
    "A mainInfo item with recognitionType set to image is detected by image matching and does not require valuePattern.",
    "dialogs contain dialog teaching data, including text checks, reference images, title templates, and layouts; they are used only for requested dialog actions and verification, not normal state polling."
  ]
